      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHITE WIND (1) makes her first outing and has drawn to advantage. Rates a leading player and bold showing expected. WATCH ME SOLDIER (4) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Hidden Bandit (20.32) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Must be included in calculations. ABBEY ROSE (7) ran a sound debut from a wide box when placed at Nowra over 365m (21.19). Some good form is emerging from her last run. Leading chance. CANYA ALL TALK (5) is a Sophie Bilal-trained newcomer by Bernardo out of Joyful. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Profiles well so watch market closely.",
